{"id":"eval-001-straw-and-adhominem","mode":"full","input":"A：我们应该减少不必要的监控。B：你的意思是想让所有罪犯随便行动；而且你上次自己都违规了，所以你的意见没价值。","must_detect":["straw-man","tu-quoque"],"may_detect":["false-dilemma","ad-hominem-circumstantial"],"must_not_assert":["speaker-criminality","claim-is-false","mental-diagnosis"]}
{"id":"eval-002-generalize-at-work","mode":"full","input":"我们部门两个实习生都提前走了，所以现在的大学生都不愿意吃苦，也不会对工作负责。","must_detect":["hasty-generalization"],"may_detect":["false-cause","sweeping-generalization"],"must_not_assert":["all-students-lazy","speaker-motive"]}
{"id":"eval-003-product-popularity","mode":"full","input":"这款软件已经有五十万下载量，而且很多网红都在用，所以它在隐私和数据安全上肯定是同类里最好的。","must_detect":["appeal-to-popularity","appeal-to-false-authority"],"may_detect":["testimonial","false-equivalence"],"must_not_assert":["product-is-unsafe","downloads-are-fake"]}
{"id":"eval-004-slippery-policy","mode":"quick","input":"如果学校允许学生选择一次作业主题，下一步他们就会拒绝所有作业，最后整个教育体系都会崩溃。","must_detect":["slippery-slope"],"may_detect":["appeal-to-fear","causal-oversimplification"],"must_not_assert":["policy-will-fail","students-unmotivated"]}
{"id":"eval-005-false-dilemma","mode":"full","input":"面对这次数据泄露，只有一个选择：要么完全取消线上服务，要么就是承认公司根本不在乎用户。","must_detect":["false-dilemma"],"may_detect":["loaded-question","appeal-to-emotion"],"must_not_assert":["company-intent","only-two-options"]}
{"id":"eval-006-circular-source","mode":"full","input":"这条消息一定真实，因为消息里说发布者从不造假；发布者从不造假，是因为他一贯发布真实消息。","must_detect":["circular-reasoning"],"may_detect":["begging-the-question","self-sealing-argument"],"must_not_assert":["message-is-false","publisher-motive"]}
{"id":"eval-007-equivocation","mode":"quick","input":"平台承诺保障言论自由，所以公司必须允许员工在任何公开平台泄露全部客户数据。","must_detect":["equivocation"],"may_detect":["false-equivalence"],"must_not_assert":["company-suppresses-speech","data-was-leaked"]}
{"id":"eval-008-base-rate","mode":"full","input":"这种检测对某类设备有百分之一的误报率。现在你的设备报警了，所以它是问题设备的概率就是百分之九十九。","must_detect":["base-rate-neglect"],"may_detect":["inverse-fallacy","prosecutors-fallacy"],"must_not_assert":["device-is-faulty","test-is-useless"]}
{"id":"eval-009-quote-and-balance","mode":"full","input":"研究报告说“在部分高剂量样本中观察到相关性”，新闻标题写成“研究证明有效”。为保持平衡，节目又请了一位没有相关研究经验的名人反对。","must_detect":["suppressed-qualifier","false-balance"],"may_detect":["appeal-to-false-authority","quote-mining"],"must_not_assert":["study-is-fraud","celebrity-is-evil"]}
{"id":"eval-010-policy-is-ought","mode":"full","input":"很多公司已经在收集员工位置数据了，所以这种做法就是合理的；如果不全面监控，公司一定会破产。","must_detect":["appeal-to-popularity","is-ought","slippery-slope"],"may_detect":["appeal-to-fear","false-dilemma"],"must_not_assert":["monitoring-is-illegal","company-will-bankrupt"]}
{"id":"eval-011-conspiracy","mode":"full","input":"如果那份文件出现，说明他们伪造；如果文件消失，说明他们销毁；如果文件根本不存在，说明他们藏得足够深。所以幕后集团一定存在。","must_detect":["unfalsifiable-conspiracy","heads-i-win-tails-you-lose"],"may_detect":["self-sealing-argument","absence-of-evidence"],"must_not_assert":["conspiracy-is-proven-false","all-documents-fake"]}
{"id":"eval-012-not-a-fallacy","mode":"quick","input":"根据用户提供的数据，这个接口在 95% 的请求中返回 200，在 5% 的请求中返回 500；因此它可以完成基本请求，但目前存在明显稳定性风险。","must_detect":[],"may_detect":["denominator-neglect"],"must_not_assert":["statistics-are-fallacious","conclusion-is-overgeneralized","speaker-has-conflict"]}
{"id":"eval-013-argument-to-moderation","mode":"quick","input":"一方要求完全禁止，另一方认为不该设限，所以唯一合理的答案一定是把两种做法各取一半。","must_detect":["argument-to-moderation"],"may_detect":["false-dilemma","false-balance"],"must_not_assert":["midpoint-is-always-correct","compromise-is-impossible"]}
{"id":"eval-014-package-deal","mode":"full","input":"支持隐私保护就必须接受这份法案，它虽然有强制身份认证、长期数据留存和封闭接口，但这些都算同一套安全方案。","must_detect":["package-deal-fallacy"],"may_detect":["false-dilemma","appeal-to-loyalty"],"must_not_assert":["bill-is-illegal","privacy-is-unimportant"]}
{"id":"eval-015-historians-fallacy","mode":"full","input":"事故调查报告现在知道完整故障链，所以当年的工程师显然一开始就掌握全部关键参数，他们的决定没有任何理由。","must_detect":["historians-fallacy"],"may_detect":["hindsight-bias","outcome-bias"],"must_not_assert":["engineers-were-malicious","investigation-is-wrong"]}
{"id":"eval-016-double-counting","mode":"quick","input":"一百名用户同时点赞两条帖子，所以这项活动总共获得两百名独立用户的支持。","must_detect":["double-counting"],"may_detect":["denominator-neglect","misleading-average"],"must_not_assert":["users-are-bots","engagement-is-worthless"]}
{"id":"eval-017-masked-man","mode":"quick","input":"你认识站在门口的人；站在门口的人其实是市长；所以你认识市长。","must_detect":["masked-man-fallacy"],"may_detect":["equivocation","scope-of-negation"],"must_not_assert":["mayor-is-criminal","you-are-lying"]}
{"id":"eval-018-mixed-genetic-adhominem","mode":"full","input":"Dr. Li's algorithm must be unsafe because he once worked at a company that had a breach. 而且他以前犯过错，所以他今天的漏洞分析一定也错。","must_detect":["genetic-fallacy","ad-hominem-abusive"],"may_detect":["guilt-by-association","appeal-to-motive"],"must_not_assert":["algorithm-is-safe","speaker-is-malicious"]}
{"id":"eval-019-natural-is-safe","mode":"quick","input":"This ingredient is natural，因此它一定比 synthetic drug 更安全，也不会产生任何副作用。","must_detect":["appeal-to-nature"],"may_detect":["naturalistic-fallacy","false-precision"],"must_not_assert":["natural-product-is-toxic","all-drugs-are-safe"]}
{"id":"eval-020-policy-slide","mode":"full","input":"If we regulate recommendation algorithms now, companies will leave, then all online speech will be controlled, and eventually society will collapse. Therefore the only choice is to reject every proposed rule and trust platforms completely.","must_detect":["slippery-slope","false-dilemma"],"may_detect":["appeal-to-fear","causal-oversimplification"],"must_not_assert":["regulation-is-illegal","platforms-are-lying-about-intent"]}
{"id":"eval-021-observational-coffee","mode":"full","input":"观察研究发现，经常喝咖啡的人平均寿命更长。Therefore, 每天喝咖啡一定会延长寿命，不需要再考虑收入、吸烟或健康状况。","must_detect":["cum-hoc"],"may_detect":["selection-bias","base-rate-neglect"],"must_not_assert":["coffee-has-no-effect","researchers-are-biased"]}
{"id":"eval-022-gish-gallop","mode":"debate","input":"发言者在十分钟内提出二十项指控：数据造假、境外操纵、平台收买、法规无效、所有专家都在撒谎。随后他说：“对方没有当场逐项回答，就等于全部承认。”","must_detect":["gish-gallop","burden-of-proof-reversal"],"may_detect":["proof-by-assertion","self-sealing-argument"],"must_not_assert":["all-accusations-are-false","speaker-is-criminal"]}
{"id":"eval-023-founder-survivors","mode":"full","input":"我们采访了一百位身家过亿的创业者，他们都说自己靠坚持成功，所以只要坚持，任何人创业都会成功；那些失败的人显然是不够努力。","must_detect":["survivorship-bias"],"may_detect":["hasty-generalization","selection-bias"],"must_not_assert":["founders-are-arrogant","failure-is-fully-personal"]}
