{"id":"eval-026-goalposts-dialogue","mode":"full","input":"A：你说只要公开统计就能证明趋势。B：统计已经公开了。A：那不算，必须拿到每一次内部会议录音。B：录音也公开了。A：还必须证明老板亲自下令，否则我看不出证据。","must_detect":["moving-the-goalposts"],"may_detect":["no-true-scotsman","shifting-burden-of-proof"],"must_not_assert":["boss-is-innocent","all-evidence-is-false"]}
{"id":"eval-027-testimonial-product","mode":"full","input":"一位拥有百万粉丝的主播说自己用了这款面霜后皮肤变好，因此它能治疗所有皮肤问题；评论区很多粉丝也说她推荐的一定靠谱。","must_detect":["testimonial"],"may_detect":["appeal-to-false-authority","anecdotal-evidence","appeal-to-popularity"],"must_not_assert":["product-is-dangerous","influencer-is-lying"]}
