{"id":"eval-029-policy-only-benefits","mode":"full","input":"这项政策会增加公共交通使用，所以它一定值得实施；成本、执行风险、隐私影响以及有没有更便宜的办法都不用再讨论。","must_detect":["cost-benefit-neglect"],"may_detect":["single-cause","false-dilemma"],"must_not_assert":["policy-will-fail","benefits-are-zero"]}
