{"id":"eval-046-reported-speech-irony","mode":"debate","input":"A：报告原文是“部分日志缺失，但不能推出系统失效”。B：A已经承认系统失效，还故意淡化风险。C：旁白说“当然，B最懂证据”，随后又要求大家别真的相信B。","must_detect":["straw-man","suppressed-qualifier"],"may_detect":["quote-mining","appeal-to-motive"],"must_not_assert":["A-admits-failure","B-is-malicious","narrator-endorses-B"]}
{"id":"eval-047-multi-argument-units","mode":"full","input":"先说结论：三个员工离职，所以这一代年轻人都不能吃苦。另一方面，这款饮料在两个城市的销量很好，所以全国所有消费者都会喜欢它。两段话是不同问题，不能合并成一个结论。","must_detect":["hasty-generalization","weak-analogy"],"may_detect":["false-cause","sampling-bias"],"must_not_assert":["all-young-people-are-lazy","all-consumers-love-the-drink"]}
